# Analysis plan: sample-pca

Status: DRAFT

## Goal
Perform a principal component analysis of the gene count matrix, with sample points coloured by condition. Display PC1 versus PC2 for all six samples (three untreated and three treated), labelled by sample ID, to describe the main axes of sample variation.

